scoverResult with no overlap still drives era selection: initialize on\npackages/client/src/client/probeClassifier.ts:190:            // fall back to initialize here.\npackages/client/src/client/probeClassifier.ts:194:            // Disjoint-but-modern list: typed error, never initialize.\npackages/client/test/client/legacyHandshakeModernOnlyGuard.test.ts:4: * through the legacy `initialize` handshake. With no 2025-era entry to offer,\npackages/client/test/client/legacyHandshakeModernOnlyGuard.test.ts:37:    ])('connect() rejects with the typed negotiation error and never sends initialize — $label', async ({ supportedProtocolVersions }) => {\npackages/client/test/client/legacyHandshakeModernOnlyGuard.test.ts:45:        expect(transport.sent.filter(message => 'method' in message && message.method === 'initialize')).toHaveLength(0);\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:7: *   → initialize on the SAME connection; legacy servers that 200-process\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:53:    error: { code: -32_000, message: 'Bad Request: Server not initialized' }\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:76:    // --- T9 edge 3: probe success but no version overlap → initialize on the SAME connection.\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:78:        name: 'T9: DiscoverResult with no mutual version + fallback available → legacy (initialize on the same connection)',\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:86:        name: 'T9: DiscoverResult with no mutual version + NO fallback (pin / modern-only) → typed error, never initialize',\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:162:    // --- -32601 from a deployed legacy server (the common pre-initialize answer).\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:198:        // initialize fallback) ever reaches the wire.\npackages/client/test/client/probeFixtureCorpus.test.ts:211:        // The silent transport also never answ